WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:08.402
A materialized view is useful when the same expensive summary is needed repeatedly and users can accept some delay

00:00:08.402 --> 00:00:10.562
between the source data and the stored result.

00:00:10.562 --> 00:00:15.392
For example, a dashboard may not need second by second updates.

00:00:15.392 --> 00:00:19.602
A snapshot refreshed every hour may be completely acceptable.

00:00:19.602 --> 00:00:22.652
But the refresh policy has to be clear.

00:00:22.652 --> 00:00:28.555
Users should know when the snapshot was last refreshed and what happens if a refresh fails.
